# XXQ Chat Web Environment Configuration

# Backend API and WebSocket Gateway URL
# For local development: http://localhost:4000
# For Render deployment: https://xxq-chat-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Firebase Client Configuration for Google Sign-In
# Obtain from Firebase Console > Project Settings > General > Your apps (Web App)
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your-project-id.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
